---
layout: layouts/base.njk
roomPage: study
title: 工具箱
description: 菜菜這一年學習會用到的軟體、工具和知識，依領域整理。
permalink: /toolbox/
---
<article class="page">
  <h1 class="page-title">工具箱</h1>
  <p class="page-sub">這一年會用到的軟體和知識。<span class="heat heat-高">高</span>是現在業界最常用的。</p>

  {%- for g in plan.tools | groupBy("area") %}
  <section class="tool-group" aria-labelledby="tg-{{ loop.index }}">
    <h2 id="tg-{{ loop.index }}">{{ g.key }}</h2>
    <ul class="tools">
      {%- for t in g.items %}
      <li>
        <p class="tool-name">{{ t.name }}<span class="heat heat-{{ t.heat }}">{{ t.heat }}</span></p>
        <p class="tool-use">{{ t.use }}<span class="muted">　→ {{ t.output }}</span></p>
      </li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
  </section>
  {%- endfor %}
</article>
